# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-2 four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-octo2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# OBA (LEVER 3, EXACTNESS): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-bundle-audit = the control plus QWEN_FAST_OCTO_ATTN_BUNDLE=4 and _AUDIT=1: the octo block's attention in two K64j launches of four users per layer, and the eight single launches run beside them in
# every layer and compared word for word in the trace (docs/tp4-octo-attn-bundle.md). Two tests only (warmup, concurrent8_steady: nine requests; the audit adds 16 x 8 launches to the trace and is not a timing arm).
# READ: c2_smoke_check clean with the bundle rule (octo_attn_bundle.bundle_problems: the engaged line once with per_launch=4,4 flags=0x21 cores_per_entry=16 audit=1, the call line, the UNQUALIFIED line, at least one
# 'audit <n> exact=True' line and no 'audit MISMATCH'). This is the only job that settles whether K64j 0x21 at B > 1 eight-row entries equals the single launches; a mismatch or a hang is NO-GO for the lever and a hang
# needs a person to reset the cards. Duration (estimate): 45 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-bundle-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady
